{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-45-1","title":"Psalms 45:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":45,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":45,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The majesty and grace of Christ's kingdom. 10 The duty of the church, and the benefits thereof.</p>\n<p>(Title.) To the chief.Or, rather, \"To the chief musician upon the hexachords, a didactic ode for the sons of Korah, and a song of loves.\" {Shoshannim} most probably denotes hexachords, or six-stringed instruments, from {shesh,} \"six:\" hence the Persian {shasta,} a six-stringed lute. This Psalm is supposed by some to be an epithalamium, or nuptial song, on the marriage of Solomon with Pharaoh's daughter; but with what propriety could Solomon be described as fairer than the children of men, a mighty warrior, a victorious conqueror, and a prince whose throne is for ever and ever? A greater than Solomon is here; and the person described is no other than the Messiah, as is acknowledged by many Jewish writers. The Targum on ver. 3 says, \"Thy beauty, {malka meshecha,} O King Messiah, is greater than the children of men;\" and the Apostle expressly quotes it as such Heb 1:8, 9. It was probably written by David after Nathan's prophetic address 1 Ch 17:27.</p>\n<p>Shoshannim. 69:1; 80:1; *titles Maschil. or, of instruction. A song. So 1:1,2-7; Isa 5:1; Eph 5:32 is inditing. Heb. boileth, or, bubbleth up. Job 32:18-20; Pr 16:23; Mt 12:35 a good. 49:3; Job 33:3; 34:4; Pr 8:6-9 touching. 2:6; 24:7-10; 110:1,2; So 1:12; Isa 32:1,2; Mt 25:34; 27:37 tongue. 2Sa 23:2; 2Pe 1:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-45-2","title":"Psalms 45:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":45,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":45,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>fairer. So 2:3; 5:10-16; Zec 9:17; Mt 17:2; Joh 1:14; Col 1:15-18 Heb 1:3,4; 7:26; Re 1:13-18 grace. Pr 22:11; Isa 50:4; Lu 4:22; Joh 7:46 God. 21:6; 72:17-19; Php 2:9-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-45-3","title":"Psalms 45:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":45,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":45,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Gird. Isa 49:2; 63:1-6; Heb 4:12; Re 1:16; 19:15,21 O most. Isa 9:6,7; Ac 10:36; Ro 14:9 glory. 21:5; 96:6; 104:1; 145:5,12; Heb 1:3; 8:1; Jude 1:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-45-4","title":"Psalms 45:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":45,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":45,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>ride, etc. Heb. prosper thou, ride thou. Re 6:2; 19:11 prosperously. 110:2,3; 1Th 1:5; 2:13; 2Th 3:1 because. 60:4; Joh 1:17; 14:6 meekness. Zec 9:9; Mt 11:29; 12:19,20; 2Co 10:1 right. 2:9; 21:8,9; 65:5; 110:5,6; Isa 59:17,18; 63:1-6; Lu 19:27 2Th 1:8,9; Re 6:16,17; 11:18; 19:17-21; 20:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-45-5","title":"Psalms 45:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":45,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":45,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Thine. 21:12; 38:2; Nu 24:8; Zec 9:13,14 sharp. 2:1-9; Lu 19:42-44; 20:18,19; Ac 2:37,41; 5:33; 7:54 people. 22:27; 66:3,4; Ac 4:4; 5:14; 6:7; Ro 15:18,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-45-6","title":"Psalms 45:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":45,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":45,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>throne. 89:29,36,37; 93:2; 145:13; Da 2:44; Lu 1:32,33; Heb 1:8 O God. Isa 9:6,7; Jer 23:5,6; Joh 1:1; 1Ti 3:16 the sceptre. 72:1-20; 2Sa 23:4; Jer 33:15,16; Re 19:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-45-7","title":"Psalms 45:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":45,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":45,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Thou. 33:5; 99:4; Mt 3:15; Heb 1:9; 7:26 hatest. 101:3,4,8; Mt 7:23; Lu 13:27; Re 21:27 God. or, O God. thy God. 89:26; Isa 61:1; Joh 20:17; Eph 1:3 hath. 89:20; Le 8:12; 1Sa 16:13; 1Ki 1:39,40; 19:16; Isa 61:1-3; Lu 3:22 Lu 4:18-21; Joh 3:34 oil. 21:6; 1Ki 1:39; Ac 2:28 above. Joh 1:16; Ro 8:29; Col 1:18,19; Heb 2:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-45-8","title":"Psalms 45:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":45,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":45,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>All. So 1:3,13; 3:6; 4:6,13,14; 5:1,5,13; Mt 2:11; Joh 19:39 2Co 2:14-16 cassia. Ex 30:23,24 ivory. 15; 1Ki 22:39; Am 3:15; Joh 14:2 whereby. 16:11; Heb 12:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-45-9","title":"Psalms 45:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":45,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":45,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Kings. 13; 72:10; So 6:8,9; 7:1; Isa 49:23; 60:10,11; Re 21:24 upon. 1Ki 2:9,19 queen. So 4:8-11; Joh 3:29; Eph 5:26,27; Re 19:7; 21:2,9 gold. 1Ki 10:11; Job 22:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-45-10","title":"Psalms 45:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":45,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":45,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Hearken. So 2:10-13; Isa 55:1-3; 2Co 6:17,18; 7:1 forget. Ge 2:24; 12:1; De 21:13; 33:9; Mt 10:37; 19:29; Lu 14:26; 2Co 5:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-45-11","title":"Psalms 45:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":45,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":45,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>So shall. So 1:8,12-16; 2:2,14; 4:1-5,7,9,10; 6:4; 7:1-10; Isa 62:4,5 Zep 3:17; Eph 5:26,27 Lord. 6; Isa 54:5; Jer 23:5,6; Joh 20:28; Ac 10:36; Ro 14:9; Php 2:10,11 Php 3:8 worship. 2:12; 95:6; Lu 24:52; Joh 4:21,22; Re 5:8-14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-45-12","title":"Psalms 45:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":45,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":45,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>And the. Isa 23:17,18; Ac 21:3-6 with. 72:10; Isa 60:6,7; Mt 2:11 rich. 22:29; Isa 49:23; 60:3,10,11 favour. Heb. face.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-45-13","title":"Psalms 45:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":45,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":45,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>king's. 9,10; So 7:1; Isa 61:10; 1Pe 2:9; Re 19:7,8 all glorious. 1Sa 16:7; Lu 11:40; Ro 2:29; 2Co 5:17; 1Pe 3:3,4 clothing. 9; Mt 5:16; 22:11,12; Ro 3:22; 13:14; Re 3:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-45-14","title":"Psalms 45:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":45,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":45,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>She. So 1:4; Joh 17:24; 2Co 11:2 raiment. Ex 28:39; Jud 5:30 virgins. So 1:3,5; 2:7; 5:8,9; 6:1,8,13; 8:13; Re 14:1-4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-45-15","title":"Psalms 45:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":45,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":45,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>With. Isa 35:10; 51:11; 55:12,13; 60:19,20; 61:10; Jude 1:24; Re 7:15-17 they shall. Isa 56:5; Joh 14:3; Re 3:12,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-45-16","title":"Psalms 45:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":45,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":45,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Instead. 22:30; Mt 19:29; Mr 10:29,30; Php 3:7,8 children. Isa 49:21,22; 54:1-5; 60:1-5; Ga 4:26,27 princes. 1Pe 2:9; Re 1:6; 5:10; 20:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-45-17","title":"Psalms 45:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":45,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":45,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>I will. 22:30,31; 72:17-19; 145:4-7; Isa 59:21; Mal 1:11; Mt 26:13 1Co 11:26 therefore. 72:17; So 6:9; Isa 61:9; 62:3</p>"}]}